dictionary rules_personal_same_kind.py: 1 fault class(es) registered
  0  strictness  (shipped)
     a token containing < or > has one "=" too many or too few (a ">=" that
     should be ">", a "<" that should be "<=", an "->" corrupted to "->=",
     including inside strings)
  1  literal-off-by-one  (shipped)
     a numeric literal on the line is exactly one greater than correct (3601
