  2  swapped-return-operands  (shipped)
     a "return a OP b" whose two operands are in the wrong order
  3  flipped-additive  (shipped)
     a binary " + " that should be " - ", or a " - " that should be " + "
     (spaces around the operator)
  4  wrong-rate-helper  (taught)
     a rate helper call that names the gross helper where the net one is meant
